# Cloud / frontend-only build: there is NO server, so no environment variables
# are needed to run or deploy this app.
#
# Users configure their own credentials in the in-app "设置" (Settings) dialog;
# everything is stored in the browser's localStorage and sent directly to the
# provider:
#   - APIMart: API Key (+ optional Base URL)
#   - Custom OpenAI-compatible endpoint: Base URL + API Key + model name
#
# The full local/full-stack version (with the Python imagegen channel and
# server-side image saving) lives on the `main` branch.
